{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is time to enter The Mortimer Files! <br><br>An oddball collection from developer Sam Mortimer. This collection brings together  games covering arcade chaos, puzzling platformers, and a host of adventures to enjoy. Each game offers its own unique charm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Included Games</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eggs</strong> \u2013 A score-chasing arcade romp where a sentient broccoli robs a farm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb the Tower</strong> \u2013 A fast-paced time attack platformer. How high can you climb?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mediocre</strong> \u2013 Sam\u2019s very first Construct game: a \u201cnext-gen\u201d platformer with scrappy charm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get In The Hole</strong> \u2013 A \u201cfinite endless runner\u201d where amateur astronauts tumble into a black hole.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mediocre 2</strong> \u2013 The follow-up platformer, bigger, bolder, and Sam\u2019s self-proclaimed magnum opus.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3905850?t=1762598286","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3905850?t=1762598286","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905850/48007987f54bbed62a4014b1cbd95034b2e6949b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762598286","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905850/48007987f54bbed62a4014b1cbd95034b2e6949b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762598286","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is time to enter The Mortimer Files! <br><br>An oddbal